msgid "Contributing {#contributing}"
msgstr "コントリビュート {#contributing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The source code is available [on GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation).\n"
msgstr "ソースコードは [GitHub 上](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation)で公開されています。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The developer guide is located at [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) in the root of this project’s repository. By participating, you are expected to uphold Qiskit’s [code of conduct](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"
msgstr "開発者ガイドは、このプロジェクトのリポジトリのルートにある [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) にあります。参加するにあたっては、Qiskit の[行動規範](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)を守っていただくことになります。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) for tracking requests and bugs.\n"
msgstr "要望やバグの追跡には [GitHub issues](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-mitigation/issues/new/choose) を使用しています。\n"

